OL,6,     FWhen Judy King's mother was dying,
OL,7,     FJudy promised her that she'd fight
OL,8,     Fto get back a suitcase that
OL,9,     Fbelonged to her - filled with
OL,10,     Fartworks drawn by a man her mother
OL,11,     Fhad once loved.
